OL,3,AAustralia's oldest department store
OL,4,ADavid Jones folds after 188 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Jones, Australia's oldest
OL,7,Fdepartment store chain, has gone into
OL,8,Fvoluntary administration, putting
OL,9,Fthousands of jobs at risk.
OL,11,FIt comes after years of financial
OL,12,Fstruggles for the 188-year-old retailer
OL,13,F- known locally as DJs - as customers
OL,14,Fdesert traditional shops for online
OL,15,Fshopping.
OL,17,FDavid Jones's physical and online
OL,18,Fstores will continue to operate while
OL,19,Freceivers FTI Consulting review the
OL,20,Fcompany, said voluntary administrators
OL,21,FMcGrathNicol.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
