OL,3,AAustralia's oldest department store
OL,4,ADavid Jones folds after 188 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"David Jones is an iconic company and
OL,7,Fso many Australians have stories and
OL,8,Fmemories of visiting DJ's stores," said
OL,9,Fits CEO Erica Berthold, adding the
OL,10,Fbrand has a "well-developed plan" to
OL,11,F"reset the business for the future".
